    <p class="head__eyebrow">The second-coffee loop</p>
    <h1>Why your second coffee keeps making the afternoon <em>worse</em></h1>
    <p class="head__sub">The 2 PM crash is not asking for another cup. It is asking for a different kind of lift.</p>
    <p class="head__signal">A simpler 2 PM option: <a href="/products/mixed-berry-kratom-gummies">Mixed Berry Kratom Gummies from Dandy</a>.</p>
  </header>

  <div class="col">
