    <p class="ba__cap">Same desk. Same 2:07 PM. A different decision.</p>
    <div class="head__by"><img class="head__avatar" src="{{ 'lpi-author-alan-bronson.jpg' | asset_url }}" width="96" height="96" alt="Alan Bronson"><span class="head__author">By <b>Alan Bronson</b></span><span>September 6, 2026</span></div>
