        <li><i><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M5 19C5 9 11 5 20 4c0 9-4 15-14 15z"/><path d="M5 19c3-4 6-7 10-9"/><path d="M14 14l3 3"/></svg></i>A “natural energy” product with caffeine hiding behind green packaging</li>
        <li><i><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M4 8h12v6a5 5 0 0 1-5 5H9a5 5 0 0 1-5-5z"/><path d="M16 10h2a2 2 0 0 1 0 4h-2"/><path d="M19 3l2 2-2 2"/></svg></i>Another cup because the last cup stopped carrying you</li>
