  <section class="sec prose col">
    <div class="num"><span class="num__n">4</span><h2>The answer is a different plant, not caffeine wearing a leaf costume</h2></div>
    <p>That is where Kratom enters the picture.</p>
    <p>Kratom comes from <em>Mitragyna speciosa</em>, a Southeast Asian tree in the coffee family.</p>
    <figure>
      <img src="{{ 'lpi-kratom-leaves-macro.jpg' | asset_url }}" width="1024" height="768" alt="Close-up of glossy green kratom leaves with red veins and water droplets against a dark background">
      <figcaption><em>Mitragyna speciosa.</em> Same family as coffee. Not the same plant.</figcaption>
    </figure>
    <p>But Kratom is not coffee with a new label. It is not another caffeine blend wearing green packaging. It is a different plant with a different kind of experience.</p>
    <p>At lower amounts, Kratom leans toward energy and focus. At higher amounts, it leans toward body ease and relaxation.</p>
    <div class="range" aria-label="How the amount changes the experience">
      <div class="range__bar"><span class="range__dot"></span></div>
      <div class="range__ends">
        <span><b>Lower amounts</b>Energy and focus</span>
        <span><b>Higher amounts</b>Body ease<br class="m"> and relaxation</span>
      </div>
    </div>
    <p>That dose-dependent range is the part most newcomers miss.</p>
    <div class="aside">
      <img src="{{ 'lpi-dandy2-rocky-flex.webp' | asset_url }}" width="560" height="560" alt="Illustration of the Dandy raccoon flexing both arms">
      <p>You are not trying to blast yourself with more stimulation. You are looking for the amount that fits the moment.</p>
    </div>
    <p>And if the moment is the afternoon slump, a small starting point makes more sense than immediately reaching for the strongest option on the shelf.</p>
  </section>

